# If you would like to instead ignore files matching the criteria here, (as opposed to upload them with your source code)
# add them to the .gitignore file instead.
#
# For more information, run:
#   $ gcloud topic gcloudignore
#
.gcloudignore
# If you would like to exclude files from the deployed version of your
